# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in MOWDEI.DAT on disc 1. This chapter's kanji and marks,
# 0x0100-0x02E5, in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high byte
# first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter shares).
# Read by eye from the font, then checked in this and the other chapters' script words. 382 of the 486 are used by
# this chapter's script.
# Not checked in a scene, since no chapter's script uses the glyph: 0x012F, 0x0131, 0x0148, 0x0153, 0x0162, 0x016A,
